The C programs in this directory (*.c) are from The Computer Language
Benchmarks Game, https://benchmarksgame-team.pages.debian.net/benchmarksgame/,
and so are the *.expected files, its output files for each program's small n.
binarytrees.c includes <stdlib.h> in place of <malloc.h>, which macOS lacks;
they are otherwise unchanged. khash.h, which knucleotide.c includes, is from
klib (https://github.com/attractivechaos/klib), under the MIT license in its
own header. pcre2_8.h is funk's.

